silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_05_relator_quotient_projection_sections_01_relator_to_congruence_closure_concrete_anchor_24_CocLegCompatibility#coclegcompatibility a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.11_base_commutative_diagram.chapters.05_relator_quotient_projection.sections.01_relator_to_congruence_closure.concrete_anchor_24_CocLegCompatibility#coclegcompatibility" .
silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_05_relator_quotient_projection_sections_01_relator_to_congruence_closure_concrete_anchor_24_CocLegCompatibility#coclegcompatibility silm:hasLongDescription "The CocLegCompatibility is the universal cocone-leg compatibility law: all incoming legs agree on the apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'CocLegCompatibility', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
